{"metadata":{"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"title":[{"Plain":"丝带范畴"},2],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"slug":[{"Plain":"丝带范畴"},0]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>观念</h2>\n<p>丝带范畴 (ribbon category) 是 "},{"Local":{"url":"ReshetikhinTuraevRibbon","text":"Reshetikhin–Turaev"}},{"Plain":" 基于"},{"Local":{"url":"辫幺半范畴","text":"辫幺半范畴"}},{"Plain":"引入的结构, 使得其 “线图” 可以画成有宽度的丝带状, 丝带可以扭.</p>\n"}]}}